  "source_rule_revision": "V1.9.0 adds static-world/dynamic-actor/camera state separation, stable IDs and project state as source of truth, project-specific timebase/integer frames, human keyframe locks, read-edit-validate-local-undo workflow, multi-view character anchors for large-angle camera motion, and reference-image responsibility mapping. V2.10.6 adds explicit per-shot facial performance states and cross-generation-segment entry/progression/exit inheritance, preventing unsupported neutral-face resets while preserving intentional restrained/poker-face acting; adds an independent zombie-face QA gate. V1.3.7 adds SCG V1.1 generation-segment grouping and per-person facial_performance state on existing shot entities; machine preflight validates declared model duration caps, cross-shot/cross-segment inheritance, offscreen carry-forward, intentional neutral acting, and event-triggered state changes. Added 15 positive/negative fixtures; CI executes the preflight and a fresh ZIP/extracted-copy package regression."
